WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,590 --> 00:00:02,310
What do you mean?

2
00:00:02,310 --> 00:00:04,910
Did I say something wrong again? Forget it

3
00:00:04,910 --> 00:00:06,750
If I have offended you in any way

4
00:00:06,750 --> 00:00:11,380
I apologize to you Jenny

5
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:12,530
what do you want to do

6
00:00:12,530 --> 00:00:13,650
Manager Xu

7
00:00:13,650 --> 00:00:15,130
Jian Tong looks down on me

8
00:00:15,130 --> 00:00:16,090
Noisy noisy noisy

9
00:00:16,090 --> 00:00:18,290
I only know how to quarrel with Jenny all day long

10
00:00:18,290 --> 00:00:19,970
You just had an argument with Annie two days ago

11
00:00:19,970 --> 00:00:21,690
Now I'm arguing with Jane again

12
00:00:21,690 --> 00:00:23,010
Working in Donghuang

13
00:00:23,010 --> 00:00:25,010
Staying safe is the first priority

14
00:00:25,010 --> 00:00:26,630
Stop stirring up trouble

15
00:00:26,630 --> 00:00:40,260
Miss Jane

16
00:00:40,260 --> 00:00:41,660
shall we meet again

17
00:00:41,660 --> 00:00:44,900
it's you

18
00:00:45,740 --> 00:00:50,650
Sir, if you have something to do, you can leave first

19
00:00:50,650 --> 00:00:52,640
Is something wrong, sir?

20
00:00:52,640 --> 00:00:54,000
I have this honor

21
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:55,480
Invite Miss Jane on board?
